* MIC_LIVE level at the CM5's GPIO5, at its corners.
* Live: MIC_VDD at CM5_3.3V's minimum, 3.135 V (3.3 V -5 %, CM5 datasheet section 4.2, pin 84),
* R4 10k +1 % from MIC_VDD, R5 100k -1 % pull-down, and the GPIO's 3 uA input
* leakage (CM5 datasheet Table 8) drawn out of the node.
* Muted: MIC_VDD has no source; only the pull-down holds the node, and the 3 uA leakage flows in.
* Limits: VIH 2.0 V and VIL 0.8 V at VGPIO_VREF = 3.3 V (CM5 datasheet Table 8).
VDD vdd 0 DC 3.135
R4 vdd live 10.1k
R5 live 0 99k
IL live 0 DC 3u
R5M muted 0 101k
IL2 0 muted DC 3u
.control
op
let v_live = v(live)
let v_muted = v(muted)
print v_live v_muted
.endc
.end
